\title{gitssh: Multi-Account Git, GitHub and SSH Helpers}
\description{
Helpers to work with Git and GitHub from R when more than one account (or more than one machine) is involved. Builds and diagnoses multi-account SSH configurations with host aliases, resolves the physical home directory when cloud-sync tools redirect user profiles, clones, pulls and pushes through the right identity, creates new repositories under the right account with guard rails, and wraps stash and forced reset/push operations with backups. Cloning and pulling public or third-party repositories works without any SSH key. Ships a trilingual (Portuguese, English, Spanish) cheat sheet, git_tips().
}
